== Problem description ==
Fixing a problem where the Switch restarts when you put it into standby

== Symptoms ==

* Switch restarts when you put it into standby

== Solution ==
Check the mosfets above the usb type c port, [[Transistors - Repair Basics|click here to learn more about MOSFETs]] and how to check them. Replace them if faulty.